{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stoatman is an exciting adventure in a perilous, fairy-tale world. You are a brave hero armed with a magical sword, destined to uncover secrets and face challenges along the way. Master powerful spells, explore mysterious locations, and battle incredible creatures in this thrilling Metroidvania adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/extras/stoatman-line-616x154.gif?t=1745931724\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious world filled with both charming and deadly creatures, hidden locations, and secret paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic combat - fight with sword strikes and powerful magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An evolving magic system - from humble spells to devastating powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive atmosphere - detailed 2D graphics, smooth animations, and intricate lighting effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A focus on exploration - discover secrets, solve puzzles, and uncover new paths, all without relying on dialogue.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664520?t=1745931724","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/a19b2079c7aa49307709578529e26f5c1bd5f848/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745931724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/6159a776e763b61d7fb6467aa367c4355bf5e2c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745931724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/6159a776e763b61d7fb6467aa367c4355bf5e2c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745931724","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"n